  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "None of it made us rich, but it did something infinitely more valuable",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1631
        },
        {
          "text": "It gave us time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1703
        },
        {
          "text": "For years, every unexpected ranch expense had felt like somebody reaching into my chest and squeezing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1720
        },
        {
          "text": "But for the first time in a long time, I could look at the numbers and imagine repairing something before it completely ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2063
        },
        {
          "text": "I could breathe",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2260
        }
      ],
      "words": 63
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“The fast one.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5216
        },
        {
          "text": "My stomach tightened",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5230
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them was of me and Blueberry—I couldn’t have been more than seventeen. Blueberry was coming around the third barr",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5594
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do you still?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5904
        },
        {
          "text": "My hand stopped against Blueberry’s neck. Children asked things adults had learned not to. Nobody in Willow Creek asked ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5918
        }
      ],
      "words": 82
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That wasn’t true, I’d ridden after the accident. Only once",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7016
        },
        {
          "text": "I had been arrogant",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7362
        },
        {
          "text": "I’d gotten into the saddle, and for approximately thirty seconds, I had felt like myself again",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7728
        },
        {
          "text": "I lasted less than five minutes",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8131
        },
        {
          "text": "I stopped trying because I couldn’t survive repeatedly meeting the woman I used to be and losing her again",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8237
        }
      ],
      "words": 59
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then I grabbed them. I’d worn them around the house, at physical therapy, around Meme. But",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9092
        },
        {
          "text": "wearing them outside was different",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9182
        },
        {
          "text": "I felt every inch of the look. My bare right leg. The visible prosthetic on my left",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9514
        },
        {
          "text": "His gaze came back to my face. “Hi, sweetheart.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9604
        },
        {
          "text": "He kissed me. The kiss wasn’t obscene enough to justify how warm my face became afterward",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9758
        }
      ],
      "words": 65
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Does the ranch make things harder on your leg?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10474
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10655
        },
        {
          "text": "“What if Jax and I take a few nights every week and knock out the heavier stuff?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10986
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then what are you trying to do?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11312
        },
        {
          "text": "“Help you keep doing it.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11344
        },
        {
          "text": "“Because I care about you. I’d offer to help if you had two legs and six arms, because you’re still one person trying to",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11915
        }
      ],
      "words": 71
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I sat beside Beau. My prosthetic remained completely visible beneath the table",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12849
        },
        {
          "text": "Margaret noticed, as did Walter, and their eyes lowered for a moment when I first walked inside. Then Margaret hugged me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12929
        },
        {
          "text": "That was it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13192
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobody stared",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13205
        },
        {
          "text": "Nobody asked what happened",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 13220
        }
      ],
      "words": 70
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I didn’t stop because riding was impossible. I stopped because I couldn’t stand knowing exactly how good I used to be",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 14989
        },
        {
          "text": "“Do you miss it?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15146
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10655
        },
        {
          "text": "“You’re not going to tell me I should try again?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15189
        },
        {
          "text": "“No.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11066
        },
        {
          "text": "His expression was almost amused. “Because you’re a grown woman and Blueberry’s your horse.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15245
        },
        {
          "text": "I closed my eyes. “Yes.” When I opened them, he was still there. “I think I do.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15660
        }
      ],
      "words": 74
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Okay.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6178
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear moved immediately through me. “That’s all you’re saying?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15743
        },
        {
          "text": "“I have plenty. But none of them matter unless you want them.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15871
        },
        {
          "text": "“What if I get up there and freak out?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15955
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then you get down.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 15993
        },
        {
          "text": "“What if I can?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16049
        },
        {
          "text": "Beau smiled. “Guess we’ll find out.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16064
        }
      ],
      "words": 51
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He carried the mounting block into the arena because I asked him to. He checked the saddle because I asked him to. He he",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16203
        },
        {
          "text": "By the time I stood beside her, my hands were trembling badly enough that I struggled with the reins",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 16367
        },
        {
          "text": "“No!” The word came out too fast. I swung down almost immediately. My boots hit the dirt awkwardly and I stumbled",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17533
        },
        {
          "text": "My breathing was ragged as my tears blurred the arena. “I can’t.” Beau said nothing. His silence made me angrier. “I fuc",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 17725
        }
      ],
      "words": 99
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I believe you.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18306
        },
        {
          "text": "Blueberry nudged my shoulder and Beau smiled faintly",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18321
        },
        {
          "text": "For the first time, getting back on wasn’t something I needed to do to prove I hadn’t lost",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18462
        },
        {
          "text": "It was simply something I wanted",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18552
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wait.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18586
        },
        {
          "text": "“Let me try again.” I stood with Blueberry until my breathing slowed. Then I moved the mounting block back into position",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18631
        },
        {
          "text": "“You ready?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 9878
        },
        {
          "text": "“No.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 11066
        },
        {
          "text": "His mouth twitched. “Good answer.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18766
        }
      ],
      "words": 73
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This time, when I mounted, I didn’t ask myself whether I looked like the girl in the photograph",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 18828
        },
        {
          "text": "Blueberry breathed beneath me",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19036
        },
        {
          "text": "We made it halfway across the arena before I asked Blueberry to stop",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19336
        },
        {
          "text": "I sat there beneath the fading October light with tears drying on my cheeks and both hands trembling against the reins",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19406
        },
        {
          "text": "I hadn’t ridden. Not really. Not the way I once understood the word",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19526
        },
        {
          "text": "Five years ago, I would’ve considered that nothing. Tonight, it felt enormous",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19671
        }
      ],
      "words": 86
    },
    {
      "block": "原句12",
      "no": 12,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I dismounted carefully. When both feet were secure, I rested my forehead against Blueberry’s neck. She stood patiently w",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19831
        },
        {
          "text": "Blueberry turned her head and nudged my shoulder. I laughed through the tears and wrapped my arms around her neck",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19964
        },
        {
          "text": "“I missed you, too.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20079
        },
        {
          "text": "He hadn’t put me on the horse",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20130
        },
        {
          "text": "He hadn’t convinced me to stay there",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20160
        },
        {
          "text": "He hadn’t fixed anything",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20197
        },
        {
          "text": "He had simply been there while I chose to try",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 20222
        }
      ],
      "words": 79
    }
